    "tpa_score_new": " ",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Attendance, homework and quiz count as 40% of total grade. Midterm exam counts as 30% of total grade. Final presentation counts as 30% of total grade.&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "請勿遲到早退並依學校規定請假\n上課期間請勿使用手機與非課堂活動之行為\n若經多次勸導無改善行為將給予適當處分",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Students should attend class on time. If you cannot arrive at the class on time due to your class time, please do not register for the class. Unless you are sick or there is an emergency, you should be in your classroom on time and in your seat before class starts. If you have to leave class early for any reason, please let me know in advance.\n2. All students are expected to treat everyone with respect in the classroom and to behave reasonably, responsibly, and courteously at all times.\n3. Do not talk, read, sleep or do other non-course-related homework during class, except for group discussions, otherwise marginal conversations should be minimized. \n4. You should listen attentively when classmates present or ask questions. When you present, you should speak loudly to your group or class so that they can hear you clearly.\n5. Laptops or tablets are allowed to take notes in class, otherwise they should be put away.\n6. Make sure that mobile devices such as mobile phones and PDAs are turned off during class, and put away and keep silent. \n7. Students are not allowed to wear earphones in class.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學生在各項考試與作業繳交應符合學術誠信，請勿作弊、代考或抄襲，若有上述情形將依規定與嚴重性給予適當處分。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Academic integrity is to ensure the core value of the university. It is&nbsp;expected&nbsp;that students will conduct themselves in an honest and ethical manner and respect the intellectual work of others.&nbsp;All the test and homework submitted&nbsp;must be your own. Therefore, please do not cheat or&nbsp;plagiarize to ensure that to acheive your learning potential.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
